	'k8c63b512' => 'People matters, settled early.',
	'k8c9cd265' => 'One complaint, in writing',
	'k8cae76d3' => 'Services · Investigations',
	'k8d4eb045' => 'Contract set €980 fixed',
	'k8f091a0c' => 'VAT at 23% is not inside the figure. The investigation is the one item published as a starting fee, from €3,800, for one complaint and up to 6 interviews. Retainers are per month, not a single project fee. The health-check report is planned in 10 working days. An investigation report is typically within 18 working days of the last interview. That timing is how we usually plan the diary.',
	'k8f2893f3' => 'per month',
	'k8f7f4c1c' => 'About',
	'k9030e39f' => 'Monthly',
	'k90998f70' => 'What you receive',
	'k909d67e9' => 'Up to 6',
	'k93c7aca6' => 'Essentials €890 a month, up to 6 hours',
	'k94b8a637' => 'Reply and term',
	'k94c67f54' => 'One adviser holds the matter from the first call through the weekly check-in to the handover. Questions come back to that person. On a retainer the same rule applies: Essentials covers up to six hours a month, Growth covers up to 14 hours and a quarterly review, and a reply goes out within one working day. The adviser has already read the contracts, the last set of payroll notes and any investigation on the file.',
	'k94db9ea4' => 'Three pieces of work, told plainly.',
	'k9516541a' => 'How an investigation runs',
	'k95e4aec3' => 'We work with companies of 15 to 400 people. The work is Irish employment law, for clients in Ireland and for remote clients across the EU. Video scoping calls are part of normal practice, not a favour. Where the law in question is not Irish, we refer the matter to a partner firm and we do not name that firm or advise on the foreign law.',
	'k95e8c6c1' => 'About the practice',
	'k96f789ae' => 'Client stories',
	'k984ceac1' => 'Included',
	'k98bfc473' => 'Client story',
	'k992a0f05' => 'Services',
	'k999cd464' => 'Approach 02',
	'k9a70397c' => 'About the fees',
	'k9ad25a38' => 'Erika Ito founded Ito HR Partners in Dublin in 2014, after twelve years in employment law. She is an employment solicitor, and she built the practice around a simple arrangement: a fixed fee, agreed in writing before work starts, with one adviser on the file.',
	'k9b535c88' => 'An employee handbook of up to 12 policies, in language a manager can apply, covering contracts, leave and remote work. A separate contract set for three role types is €980 fixed.',
	'k9bef999d' => 'Approach 01',
	'k9ce95a03' => 'Plan 02',
	'k9db9baba' => 'Questions we hear first.',
	'k9e076f58' => 'Not found',
	'k9e216c78' => 'Up to 12 policies',
	'k9e476387' => 'Policies',
	'k9e49e038' => 'An hour is time an adviser spends on your file. That includes calls, drafting, and reading the papers you send. The published figures are caps: up to 6 hours on Essentials and up to 14 hours on Growth. They are not targets we aim to exhaust.',
	'k9f0d47cb' => 'Erika Ito',
	'k9f49d7c7' => 'VAT at 23% is extra on every row. The investigation is priced from €3,800 because scope can move it, and it is still agreed in writing before interviews. Both retainers have a minimum term of 3 months, then monthly. The same figures apply for remote clients across the EU.',
	'ka1b1f521' => 'A payroll compliance review covers one payroll cycle for up to 150 staff. Lucía Ferrer, our payroll compliance specialist, leads the review. We do it with your payroll provider. The work is advisory. We do not run payroll, calculate the next run for you, or take over the payslip file.',
	'ka249de43' => 'Up to 14 hours a month, plus a quarterly review, reply within 1 working day.',
	'ka34f8497' => 'One adviser on the file',
	'ka39b34df' => 'How it starts',
	'ka3fd5654' => '24 Harcourt Lane, Dublin 2, D02 X940, Ireland',
	'ka50bf612' => 'founded in Dublin',
	'ka52945db' => 'Leave',
	'ka5971303' => 'Investigations',
	'ka624caa3' => 'Bullying',
	'ka6582f41' => 'Principle 02',
	'ka7392d01' => 'We reply to a new enquiry within 1 working day. After the free 30-minute scoping call, the written fixed quote arrives within 2 working days. The HR health check report is planned for 10 working days. A workplace investigation report is typically issued within 18 working days of the last interview. That investigation timing is typical of how we schedule the work.',
	'ka830ab36' => 'Interviews',
	'ka99e3884' => 'Sophie Laurent',
	'kab22d14b' => 'One payroll cycle, up to 150 staff. We do the review with your provider and we do not run payroll.',
	'kac848fa2' => 'Team',
	'kaef643a5' => 'Part 02',
	'kaf44ace2' => 'Price list',
	'kaf6350aa' => 'Quarterly review',
	'kaff4d12a' => 'Payslip content',
	'kb01b19ca' => 'The reason for the fixed fee is practical. A founder should know the figure before drafting or interviews begin. The published list is the figure. VAT at 23% is extra, and the quote says so. Open-ended hourly billing is not how this office works. There are 7 advisers and 4 service areas: payroll compliance, policies and handbooks, workplace investigations, and retainer support. The office is at 24 Harcourt Lane, Dublin 2, D02 X940.',
	'kb0b95ef1' => '€890 per month',
	'kb0cb39a4' => 'Seven advisers work from Dublin, and one of them holds your file. Amara Okoye is HR policy lead. Daniel Byrne is senior employment lawyer and investigations lead. Lucía Ferrer is payroll compliance specialist.',
	'kb16d9e8a' => 'The handover is the handbook, the policies that were in scope, and, if you commissioned it, the contract set. You can reuse them. Questions on the written work are included for 30 days. We reply to enquiries within 1 working day. Companies of 15 to 400 people use the same model. Advice is on Irish law, including for remote clients across the EU.',
	'kb25277c4' => 'Holiday pay',
	'kb2a4880f' => 'Up to 12 policies, plain language',
	'kb2c845be' => 'Ito HR Partners advises companies of 15 to 400 people on Irish employment law and the HR work that sits beside it. The practice was founded in Dublin in 2014. Remote clients across the EU are welcome. Advice stays on Irish law. Where a question belongs in another jurisdiction, we pass it to a partner firm, and we do not publish those firms\' names.',
	'kb309c085' => 'Workplace investigation',
	'kb402ec1e' => 'An independent look at one complaint, whether a grievance, a disciplinary matter or bullying. Scope agreed first, up to six interviews and a findings report.',
	'kb6f02258' => 'The minimum term is 3 months, then monthly. The fee is the published monthly figure, €890 or €1,850, excluding VAT at 23%, for each month of that term. Scope is agreed in writing before the first month. Sophie Laurent, client manager for retainers, looks after the relationship once the quote is agreed. The scoping call that precedes it is €0 and lasts 30 minutes.',
	'kb70991fe' => 'Founder and employment solicitor',
	'kb95a0001' => 'Ito HR Partners was founded in Dublin in 2014 by Erika Ito, after twelve years in employment law. Seven advisers work with companies of 15 to 400 people, at a fee agreed before we start.',
