	'kd3ac4aaa' => 'From first call to handover',
	'kd4509c6a' => 'A report is typically issued within 18 working days of the last interview. That is how we plan the diary. The clock runs from the last interview, not from the scoping call. The free call, the quote within 2 working days, and the interviews all come before that count begins. Follow-up questions on the report are included for 30 days after handover.',
	'kd4866a79' => 'advisers',
	'kd497423b' => 'Enquire',
	'kd5adc46d' => 'All four exclude VAT at 23%. The scoping call is the start of the other three. A written fixed quote follows within 2 working days, and work starts when you agree it in writing. Companies of 15 to 400 people use the same list.',
	'kd761b586' => '3 months, then monthly',
	'kd7b0a10a' => 'HR advice that reads like a plan, not a warning.',
	'kd7d6e64e' => 'An independent investigation helps when a company needs someone outside the line management chain to look at one complaint. The usual matters are a grievance, a disciplinary case, or bullying. Ito HR Partners does this for companies of 15 to 400 people, under Irish law. Daniel Byrne, senior employment lawyer, leads the work. Tomasz Wójcik is our workplace investigator and works on these files.',
	'kd8d84cdf' => '<a class="ih-pill" href="/fees/#health-check"><span class="ih-pill__label">Fixed fee</span><span class="ih-pill__chip">HR health check</span><span class="ih-pill__price">€1,450</span><span class="ih-pill__text">Policies, contracts and payroll reviewed, written report in 10 working days</span><span class="ih-pill__disc" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>',
