	'kdc7d3d42' => 'Fixed fee',
	'kdcb33953' => 'A written handover, plus 30 days of follow-up questions included. We reply within 1 working day. After that, a retainer is available if you want the same adviser to stay.',
	'kdd545048' => 'founded',
