	'kdf54152c' => 'Findings',
	'kdff9299d' => 'Handbook',
	'ke0210de6' => 'The fee, and a design-studio grievance',
	'ke1ca74b7' => 'A 140-person hospitality group asked us to review holiday pay across four sites. The work was a payroll review. Corrections were documented and paid. The group is anonymised, and we do not name the sites or the sum that was paid.',
	'ke3258d2f' => 'Thirty minutes by video or at the office, then a written fixed quote in 2 working days',
	'ke34293a4' => 'Advisers',
	'ke382d9f5' => 'Scope is one complaint, agreed in writing before the interviews. The written quote names the complaint, the fee, and the cap of up to 6 interviews. We send that quote within 2 working days of the free 30-minute scoping call. Work starts when the quote is agreed.',
