	'kea050c8c' => 'What we check, and what you receive',
	'keab1106d' => 'No. Every fee on this page excludes VAT at 23%. The HR health check is €1,450 fixed before VAT. The contract set is €980 fixed before VAT. The payroll compliance review is €1,900 fixed before VAT. The handbook and policies are €2,400 fixed before VAT. The investigation is from €3,800 before VAT. Retainer Essentials is €890 per month before VAT, and Retainer Growth is €1,850 per month before VAT.',
	'keb7297e9' => 'Fee',
	'keb9e46c0' => 'Stage 02',
	'kec0375df' => 'Do the published fees include VAT?',
	'kee270489' => 'Contracts, policies and payroll; report in 10 days',
	'kee4b9550' => 'Onboarding papers',
	'kee9776d6' => 'Every figure on this site is in euro and excludes VAT at 23%. The number you accept is tied to a scope written down before we start. A change of scope is a new written quote, not an open hourly bill. A health check is €1,450 fixed. A payroll compliance review is €1,900 fixed. An investigation is from €3,800.',
	'kee9df92d' => 'Fees are fixed and agreed in writing before we start, so a health check, a handbook or an investigation does not drift into open-ended hours. Clients outside Dublin work with us by video from across the EU. The advice is limited to Irish law. Where a question belongs in another jurisdiction, we say so and turn to a partner firm, without naming that firm here. A written health check comes back in 10 working days.',
	'kef747a4a' => 'Founded in Dublin in 2014',
	'kefc94f30' => 'Contracts, policies and payroll set-up, with a written report in 10 working days.',
	'kf04fc40d' => 'Fixed scope, plain language, one adviser.',
	'kf0643a07' => 'Excl. VAT',
	'kf1c4dccc' => '7 advisers',
	'kf2bc7eb2' => 'Call, email, or book a free 30-minute scoping call by video or at the Dublin office. We reply within one working day.',
	'kf33fd573' => 'Payslips',
	'kf48d24a1' => 'An independent look at one complaint, with up to 6 interviews and a findings report. The fee is from €3,800, agreed in writing before the first interview.',
	'kf4c6f851' => 'Notes',
	'kf4f979d2' => 'Retainer Growth is €1,850 per month, excluding VAT at 23%. It includes up to 14 hours of adviser time in the month, a reply within 1 working day, and a quarterly review. The quarterly review is a written look at what the quarter contained and what is still open. It is included in the monthly fee, not billed beside it.',
	'kf630e512' => 'An hour is adviser time on your file: calls, drafting, and reading. The hour figures are caps. A retainer does not include a workplace investigation, a payroll compliance review, or a full handbook project. Those stay on their own published fees. Scope is agreed in writing before the first month, after the free 30-minute scoping call and a quote within 2 working days.',
	'kf7e445dd' => 'The HR health check is €1,450 fixed. It reviews contracts, policies and payroll set-up, and the written report is planned for 10 working days. Choose the health check when you want a wider first look. Choose the payroll review when one cycle needs the five checks in full. Neither fee includes VAT. Neither engagement puts us in the role of your payroll provider.',
	'kfa213deb' => 'Step 03',
	'kfa297992' => 'Five checks on one payroll cycle',
	'kfc9ec29d' => 'Plan 01',
	'kfd7946cb' => 'What we hold to',
	'kfdb7655d' => 'HR health check',
	'kfde1f0a1' => 'Reply in 1 working day',
	'kfedfce43' => 'Both retainers run for a minimum of 3 months, then monthly. Essentials is €890 per month for up to 6 hours, with a reply within 1 working day. Growth is €1,850 per month for up to 14 hours, with a reply within 1 working day and a quarterly review included. VAT at 23% is extra on both.',
	'kff4d2e00' => 'Up to 12 policies.',
	'kffa89409' => 'Amara Okoye, HR policy lead, holds this work. We agree in the written quote which of the twelve the company needs. A smaller company may need fewer. We write only those. Each policy is in plain language, meant to be read by a manager without a lawyer beside them. The fee for the handbook and policies is €2,400 fixed, excluding VAT at 23%.',
